invariant: INV-7
file: quic.c
catches: quic_driver_test
reason: ch_quic_switch_version takes a switch to the version the session
  already negotiated, which spends the one switch RFC 9369 section 4.1
  allows on no change. test/quic_version_tests.h requires CH_EINVAL for
  a switch to version 1 in a version 1 session.

--- old
    if (!switch_open(q) || !quic_version_derived(version) ||
        version == q->t.quic_negotiated_version) {
--- new
    if (!switch_open(q) || !quic_version_derived(version)) {
